## Skills and agents

Custom Claude Code skills live in `.claude/skills/`. The main agent is `.claude/agents/drupal-issue-agent.md`.

### Agents
- `drupal-issue-agent` — full lifecycle: MR review (Path A) and new issue implementation (Path B)
- `drupal-issue-catchup` — sync after time away: fetches new comments/threads, updates record, briefs human
- `drupal-repo-setup` — sub-agent for git/module setup: clone, remote, checkout, worktree

### Entry point skills
- `drupal-issue-start` — **PRIMARY ENTRY POINT**: load/create issue record, fetch live context, present report, wait for direction
- `issue-record-update` — append timestamped session log to `issues/<nid>/README.md` (writes directly, no confirmation)
- `issue-record-screenshot` — capture a browser screenshot into `issues/<nid>/screenshots/` via Claude-in-Chrome
- `drupalorg-comment-format` — draft and save comments to `issues/<nid>/comments/` (HTML for Drupal.org, GFM for GitLab)

### Other key skills
- `drupal-issue-reroll` — rebase a branch on latest upstream, run checks, force-push
- `drupal-gitlab-inline-comments` — fetch MR inline threads and issue notes
- `drupal-coding-standards` — PHPCS/PHPCBF via ddev with automatic module config detection
- `drupalorg-cli` — reference stub; run `drupalorg skill:get drupalorg-cli` before using any `drupalorg` command
- `ddev-expert` — ddev environment management, troubleshooting, container commands
